Implements the LOWEST gambit selector (ai.s.LOWEST), which LSB leaves returning nothing.
Adds CMobSpellContainer::GetWorstAvailable, the mirror of GetBestAvailable: same lists and
spell-family filter, but it returns the first castable match (spell lists load ORDER BY
min_level), so LOWEST honours its spell-family argument the same way HIGHEST does.
